mpleted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When adding a node the tablets of the internal txn status table (system.transactions) do not seem to be rebalance and yb-tserver attempting to remote bootstrap such a table complains with the following error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nW1001 16:29:08.800905 74055680 tablet_service.cc:1447] Start remote bootstrap failed: Remote error (yb/rpc/outbound_call.cc:375): \\\r\nUnable to begin remote bootstrap session: Error initializing remote bootstrap session for tablet 035dbd9823454a6c97405b402080241f: \\\r\nNot found (yb/common/wire_protocol.cc:152): Received error code UNKNOWN_ERROR from remote service: Unable to create checkpoints directory \\\r\n/Users/kannan/yb-data/node-3/disk-1/yb-data/tserver/data/rocksdb/table-cc061729f8df4d97afb520ef4f10a9cd/tablet-035dbd9823454a6c97405b402080241f/checkpoints: /Users/kannan/yb-data/node-3/disk-1/yb-data/tserver/data/rocksdb/table-cc061729f8df4d97afb520ef4f10a9cd/tablet-035dbd9823454a6c97405b402080241f/checkpoints: No such file or directory (error 2)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSteps to repro on a local/pseudo cluster:\r\n```\r\n# create a cluster\r\n% ./bin/yb-ctl --rf 3 --data_dir $HOME/yb-data start\r\n# run unique-sec-index workload\r\n% java -jar yb-sample-apps.jar --workload CassandraUniqueSecondaryIndex --nodes 127.0.0.1:9042 --num_threads_read 4 --num_threads_write 2\r\nlet above run for a little bit...\r\n\r\n# Add a 4th node\r\n./bin/yb-ctl --rf 3 --data_dir $HOME/yb-data add_node\r\n```\r\nCheck http://127.0.0.1:7000/tablet-servers to see if tablets and leaders end up balancing or not. In my test it gets stuck when we try to move the first tablet of the system.transactions table.","closed_by":{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","fol